  row('4', 'Watching', 'Nvidia\'s CEO search and any successor shortlist; final prisoner-exchange numbers and the next trilateral round, with Europe inside; Saudi or American answers to the claimed attacks; SEBI\'s observations on IL JIN\'s DRHP; Bosch\'s postal ballot; Tech Mahindra\'s bonus record date.'),
